 "solution": "\\(\\dfrac{2}{x+3}+\\dfrac{1}{x-3}=\\dfrac{2(x-3)+(x+3)}{(x+3)(x-3)}=\\dfrac{3x-3}{(x+3)(x-3)}\\)。\n原式\\(=\\dfrac{3(x-1)}{(x+3)(x-3)}\\cdot\\dfrac{(x+3)(x-3)}{(x-1)^2}\\)。\n原式\\(=\\dfrac{3}{x-1}\\)。",
